OL,3,ATemperatures forecast to hit 25C but
OL,4,Aheatwave chances fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is set to turn warmer across the
OL,7,FUnited Kingdom over the next few days,
OL,8,Fwith temperatures peaking around 25C
OL,9,F(77F).
OL,11,FWidely, however, temperatures will
OL,12,Fclimb into the low 20s Celsius, which
OL,13,Fis around five degrees higher than the
OL,14,Faverage for late September.
OL,16,FIt will also stay mostly dry with some
OL,17,Fsunny spells, though rain is likely at
OL,18,Ftimes across northern and western parts
OL,19,Fof the UK.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
