OL,3,ATemperatures forecast to hit 25C but
OL,4,Aheatwave chances fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe warmth is likely to last for much
OL,7,Fof the week across England and Wales
OL,8,Fwhile it gets a bit cooler in Scotland
OL,9,Fand Northern Ireland.
